# Generated docs — regenerated by the build (sources: Documentation/ReleaseNotes.md,
# GuitarTap/Views/HelpView.swift, Documentation/Manual/ch*.md); distributed on the website +
# App Store. Sources stay tracked; rendered outputs are ignored.
Documentation/ReleaseNotes-*.md
Documentation/ReleaseNotes-*.pdf
Documentation/GuitarTap-Quick-Start-Guide.md
Documentation/GuitarTap-Quick-Start-Guide.pdf
Documentation/Manual/GuitarTap-User-Manual*.html
Documentation/Manual/GuitarTap-User-Manual*.pdf
# Also generated by generate-manual.sh — the redirect stub that points ...manual/ at
# the current version. It was tracked only because the two patterns above name the
# manual files and it does not match either; nothing chose to version it. The
# deployment copy is tracked in guitar_tap_website/manual/index.html, which is the
# repo that IS the deployment record, so tracking it here gave two sources of truth
# and left the manual directory dirty after every build.
Documentation/Manual/index.html
# Intermediates written during the build.
Documentation/Manual/nav.html
Documentation/Manual/ch00-toc.html
